Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:06.95,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}5{\fs68}号晚 中网第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.95,0:00:09.03,TL,,0,0,0,,一分被判重打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:11.54,TL,,0,0,0,,当时孙心然首盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:14.09,TL,,0,0,0,,高芙发球 小分{\fs78}15{\fs68}平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.09,0:00:15.54,TL,,0,0,0,,孙心然打出好球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:18.60,TL,,0,0,0,,原本会让高芙变成{\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}30{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:21.07,TL,,0,0,0,,注意 这还不是盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:23.61,TL,,0,0,0,,侧边{\fs78}LED{\fs68}在回合中闪动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.61,0:00:25.48,TL,,0,0,0,,回看后判重打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:27.05,TL,,0,0,0,,比分退回{\fs78}15{\fs68}平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.05,0:00:29.56,TL,,0,0,0,,重打高芙赢分并保发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:33.19,TL,,0,0,0,,孙心然最终{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}告负
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.39,0:00:35.62,TL,,0,0,0,,按规则 外部干扰成立
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.62,0:00:37.05,TL,,0,0,0,,要把整分从头来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.05,0:00:38.83,TL,,0,0,0,,发球也回到一发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.83,0:00:41.19,TL,,0,0,0,,这不是判高芙直接得分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:44.00,TL,,0,0,0,,对手故意妨碍 才判对手丢分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:46.95,TL,,0,0,0,,不构成妨碍 则原得分有效
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.19,0:00:51.63,TL,,0,0,0,,视频回看核查干扰 不是判断落点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:53.36,TL,,0,0,0,,申请时机是否合法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:56.13,TL,,0,0,0,,仍要看中网的具体程序
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.19,0:00:58.54,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年罗马
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:00.15,TL,,0,0,0,,安德列娃的制胜球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.15,0:01:02.41,TL,,0,0,0,,也因灯突然开启重打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:05.15,TL,,0,0,0,,她当时落泪 后来赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.55,0:01:08.69,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The lights were turned on{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N灯打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.69,0:01:10.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}before Andreeva hit the ball{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在安德列娃击球之前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:12.85,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That means there was a hindrance{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这意味着出现了干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.85,0:01:14.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}We will replay the point{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一分需要重打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.95,0:01:16.90,TL,,0,0,0,,主办方当然要负责
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:18.61,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}WTA{\fs68}明确要求
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:21.58,TL,,0,0,0,,球员准备发球后 广告不得变化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:22.50,TL,,0,0,0,,重打一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.50,0:01:26.06,TL,,0,0,0,,不能把赛事方的保障责任一笔勾销
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.87,0:01:29.44,TL,,0,0,0,,侧边广告可以在两分之间换
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:30.98,TL,,0,0,0,,底线后面的广告
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.98,0:01:33.31,TL,,0,0,0,,只能在一局结束后换
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.31,0:01:34.78,TL,,0,0,0,,两种位置都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.78,0:01:38.10,TL,,0,0,0,,球员准备发球以后 必须保持稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:41.08,TL,,0,0,0,,赛事违规可警告 罚款
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.08,0:01:44.34,TL,,0,0,0,,但本场是否处罚 尚无结论
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.09,0:01:47.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}War bitter enttäuscht{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她非常失望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.41,0:01:49.59,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}nach dem ersten Satz, Sun Xinran,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘结束后的孙心然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.59,0:01:50.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}die sich erst mal{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.61,0:01:51.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}die Tränen trocknen musste.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦去了眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.74,0:01:54.22,TL,,0,0,0,,孙心然自己说 那一局有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.22,0:01:56.54,TL,,0,0,0,,却因为自己的原因没拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.54,0:01:59.97,TL,,0,0,0,,看着机会流失 情绪有些崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:03.35,TL,,0,0,0,,她还说 第二盘情绪受到影响
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.80,0:02:06.23,TL,,0,0,0,,下一次 会更好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.49,0:02:07.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So I'm looking forward{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N所以我很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.83,0:02:09.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to the future matchups we have.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N未来与她再次交手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.47,0:02:12.97,TL,,0,0,0,,比分能重置 感觉未必能一起退回去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.97,0:02:14.72,TL,,0,0,0,,期待更可靠的赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:17.25,TL,,0,0,0,,也期待她握住下一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.25,0:02:18.59,TL,,0,0,0,,你呢？
